35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, the quote is thirty-four thousand yen per room! That’s huge. Plus, two rooms are freezing traps. We can’t just split it evenly!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
