39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, the template is worse. It means keying in every invoice and computing five separate refunds. That’s hours of work, not a solution.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, three weeks of write-offs sounds like a nightmare! I just want to know if my room is actually colder, so I stop wearing a coat indoors.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
