43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the math is the least of our problems. The monitors show a four-to-one usage gap. We’re paying for someone else’s heater. I need to know if we can fix the split without the electrician’s price tag.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
